<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS3" title="In Appendix D Evaluation Metrics ‣ Memento: Reconstruct to Remember for Consistent Long Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.3 </span>Subject Consistency</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS4" title="In Appendix D Evaluation Metrics ‣ Memento: Reconstruct to Remember for Consistent Long Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.4 </span>Aesthetic Quality</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS5" title="In Appendix D Evaluation Metrics ‣ Memento: Reconstruct to Remember for Consistent Long Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.5 </span>Inter-Shot Consistency</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS5.SSS0.Px1" title="In D.5 Inter-Shot Consistency ‣ Appendix D Evaluation Metrics ‣ Memento: Reconstruct to Remember for Consistent Long Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">ViCLIP-based inter-shot consistency.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS5.SSS0.Px2" title="In D.5 Inter-Shot Consistency ‣ Appendix D Evaluation Metrics ‣ Memento: Reconstruct to Remember for Consistent Long Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">DINOv2-based inter-shot subject consistency.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS5.SSS0.Px3" title="In D.5 Inter-Shot Consistency ‣ Appendix D Evaluation Metrics ‣ Memento: Reconstruct to Remember for Consistent Long Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Character-grouped inter-shot consistency.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
